<title>SOUTH KOREA: SOCCER-SOUTH KOREA BEAT HONG KONG IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOUTH KOREA BEAT HONG KONG IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea beat Hong Kong 4-0</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in a World Cup soccer Asian zone first round,</p>
<p>group six qualifier in Taejon on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Yoo Sang-chul 25 penalty, Choi Yong-soo 40, 70, Park Kun-ha</p>
<p>85.</p>
<p>    Standings		P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> South Korea		 3   3   0   0   9   1   9</p>
<p> Thailand		    3   1   0   2   5   6   3</p>
<p> Hong Kong		   4   1   0   3   3  10   3</p>
<p>Remaining match: June 1 South Korea v Thailand</p>
</text>
